    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Instead of moving greedily like we did before, we'll iteratively fit different combinations of items in the knapsack and choose the combination that ensures the most profit."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "As such, we'll be using a table to store the profit from each combination."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "But taking 35 units weight will result in a table with 36 columns, which will become hard to understand."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "So, we'll be modifying the weights and values to make the DP table more manageable."
    },
